items.source:
Parse a <code>hostAndPort</code> string into <a href="RedisNode.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection"><code>RedisNode</code></a>. Supports IPv4, IPv6, and hostname notations including
the port. For example:

<pre class="code">RedisNode.fromString("127.0.0.1");
RedisNode.fromString("127.0.0.1:6379");
RedisNode.fromString("[aaaa:bbbb::dddd:eeee]");
RedisNode.fromString("[aaaa:bbbb::dddd:eeee]:6379");
RedisNode.fromString("my.redis.server");
RedisNode.fromString("my.redis.server:6379");
</pre>

items.translation:
将 <code>hostAndPort</code> 字符串解析为 <a href="RedisNode.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection"><code>RedisNode</code></a>。支持 IPv4、IPv6 和主机名表示法，包括端口号。例如：

<pre class="code">RedisNode.fromString("127.0.0.1");
RedisNode.fromString("127.0.0.1:6379");
RedisNode.fromString("[aaaa:bbbb::dddd:eeee]");
RedisNode.fromString("[aaaa:bbbb::dddd:eeee]:6379");
RedisNode.fromString("my.redis.server");
RedisNode.fromString("my.redis.server:6379");
</pre>
